0.03  Seed data
      - Add standalone seeder scaffolding and execution by named connection.
      - Validate seed files before a batch and run its data writes in one transaction.

0.02  First standalone release
      - Remove the framework dependency and introduce Yggdrasil::Collection.
      - Add explicitly bound model APIs for named connections and multiple managers.
      - Add keyset pagination without COUNT and validate offset pagination inputs.
      - Keep mandatory soft-delete, relationship and cursor scopes separate from user ORs.
      - Reject unsafe write shapes and accidental stored primary-key changes.
      - Improve transaction failure handling, pivot sync and migration previews.
      - Redact bindings in callback logs by default and select DBD::MariaDB explicitly.
